---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import pfp from '../assets/pfp.png';
---

<Layout
  description="Learn about Lex Wu, a multidisciplinary journalist, musician, photographer, and creator combining storytelling, technology, and the arts across creative projects."
  title="About Me · Lex Wu"
>


  <section class="grid max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 items-stretch content-stretch align-center gap-8 gap-x-8 gap-y-8 pt-8">

    <div class="bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-800/25 gap-8 rounded-3xl px-4 py-4 sm:gap-10 flex">
      <div class="flex max-w-xl flex-col items-start gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-medium sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-display">
          About Me
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl">
          Learn more about a person that does way too much stuff.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 py-8 px-4 w-full content-start mx-auto max-w-7xl">

    <div class="gap-4 grid text-primary-950/70 dark:text-primary-200/70 content-start h-fit bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-800/25 rounded-3xl px-4 py-4 h-full">
      <p>
        Lex Wu (they/them) is a journalist, musician, photographer, and multimedia specialist telling stories in innovative ways.
      </p>
      <p>
        Based between New Hampshire and New York, Lex is studying journalism down south while blending their various expertises to tell new stories up north.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a journalist, Lex is focused on telling important and pertinent news, arts, and technology stories, among other topics.
      </p>
      <p>
        As a musician, composer, arranger, producer, and everything else related to music, Lex creates instrumental and lyrical works that explore emotions that drive their everyday life. Their music spans original compositions, production work for other artists, and soundtrack work for various projects.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond journalism and music, Lex works across photography, audio production, design, and web development. They create digital spaces and stories through every medium they've picked up along the way.
      </p>
      <p>
        Their independent projects include original music releases, podcasts, and experimental ventures.
      </p>
      <p>
        When they are not writing, composing, or building, Lex can be found performing with musical ensembles, exploring new creative tools, photographing the world around them, or crafting the next big idea.
      </p>
      <p>
        Lex has realized they hate talking about themselves in the third person.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="w-full h-full gap-8 grid">
      <Image src={pfp} alt="Lex Wu looking upwards and to the left against a dark blue sky." class="object-cover w-full h-full rounded-3xl" width="1280" height="1280" />
    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>
